# Auto-detect text files, force LF in index and working tree
# Prevents CRLF noise from Windows editors (Kiro, VS Code) in WSL-accessed files
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files (git usually detects these, but being explicit is safer)
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
